   "body": {
    "en": "Measuring the magnetic moment tells us the number of unpaired electrons and so the hybridisation. [Co(NH₃)₆]³⁺ is diamagnetic: d²sp³. [CoF₆]³⁻ has four unpaired electrons: sp³d². [Ni(CN)₄]²⁻ is diamagnetic: dsp². [NiCl₄]²⁻ has two unpaired electrons: sp³. VBT has limits: it is qualitative, it does not explain colour, it cannot predict whether a complex will be inner or outer orbital without magnetic data, and it does not distinguish weak and strong ligands.",
